Pep Chavarria might end up being Chelsea’s most interesting signing of the season.

Neither a precocious youngster nor a well-known veteran, the 28-year-old left-back has been profiled for his ability to do a very specific job on the pitch.

@liam_twomey and @ThomHarris_ explore what the Spaniard's tenacity and ball-carrying ability would bring to Stamford Bridge.
